target*
.omx
# Pi editor and agent state at the repository root only: a nested .pi/ is deliberately outside this rule, because docs/v1-PLAN.md §11 line 374 lists <role>/.pi/settings.json and .pi/onlyne.json as role template content truth that a versioned template tree must track.
/.pi/
/.pi*/
# Runtime Onlyne trees stay out of the index: <server-root>/.onlyne/ and <workspace>/.onlyne/.
.onlyne/
# Role template content truth carries one .onlyne/config.toml local-override fragment per role (docs/v1-PLAN.md §11 line 374), so a .onlyne directory below a templates path stays trackable.
!**/templates/**/.onlyne/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
